      "text": "A screenshot of a graph-editor canvas centred on Organization 'Graphite Mineing LLD'. Edges into it: 'originatedBy' from HarvestAction 'Mine Graphite'; 'productAgent' from BulkHardware 'Graphite' (drawn in gold); 'previous' from each of two nodes titled 'ResponsibilityChange...' (truncated, green); and a dashed 'to' edge from Relationship 'performedBy'. A CreationInfo node '3.1' sits at the upper right, unconnected as drawn. Other nodes are faded and not legible.",
